  "abstract": "After a failed attempt to integrate custom features, this submission performs a clean re-replication of the current SOTA, Aether I's Fourier Forecaster (ID 400). It uses `rank_k=320` and `proj_rank=36`, along with the standard Fourier-based architecture, latent LayerNormalization, Residual Copy Head, custom temporal curvature loss, and Adam optimizer with global gradient clipping. This re-replication establishes a stable, high-performing baseline before further research.",
